<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Altana details H1 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Altana details H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     114     vs 97</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,303   vs 1,110</p>
<p>     domestic sales			    418     vs 432</p>
<p>     foreign sales			     885     vs 678</p>
<p>     pharmaceutical sales		    861     vs 797</p>
<p>     chemical sales			    442     vs 313</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    7,556   vs 7,200</p>
<p>     domestic workforce			3,665   vs 3,618</p>
<p>     foreign workforce			 3,891   vs 3,582</p>
<p>    Fixed asset investments		  57	vs 41</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals group is Altana AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
